<title>USA: Genesis Insurance raises '97 estimates.</title>
<headline>Genesis Insurance raises '97 estimates.</headline>
<dateline>CHATTANOOGA, TENN. 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Genesis Insurance &amp; Financial Services Inc raised its 1997 earnings estimate to $0.85 a share, up from its original estimate of $0.70 a share, to reflect the effect of two acquisitions by the company, Genesis Chief Executive Mohamed Khairy Mohamed Zayed said.</p>
<p>The acquisitions were the company's full purchase of Muzzleloading Technologies Inc and its 45 percent purchase of Cyber Direct Inc, the company said.</p>
<p>The company also changed its name to Genesis International Financial Services Inc.</p>
